WEBVTT

00:10.110 --> 00:11.820
All right! I'm back!

00:11.820 --> 00:14.320
Jeez, you made us worry.

00:15.190 --> 00:16.280
Sorry, sorry.

00:16.780 --> 00:19.370
It seems like she's fine.

00:19.370 --> 00:20.700
Yeah.

00:23.410 --> 00:26.580
You're having the sixth-years play in overtime, right?

00:26.580 --> 00:27.870
Yeah.

00:27.870 --> 00:30.080
We agree, too.

00:31.040 --> 00:33.840
We want to see you all at full power.

00:33.840 --> 00:35.210
I don't like to admit it,

00:35.210 --> 00:39.300
but this is for the best, considering your stamina and ability.

00:39.590 --> 00:42.640
I guess we gotta go all out then.

00:43.720 --> 00:45.060
U-Um...

00:45.390 --> 00:47.640
Y-You say it first, Hii.

00:47.640 --> 00:50.310
What? No, you go first, Tsuba.

00:51.480 --> 00:52.320
What's wrong?

00:54.230 --> 00:58.070
D-Do your best in overtime...

00:58.070 --> 01:00.070
W-We're cheering you on.

01:01.490 --> 01:03.080
Okay! Thanks!

01:05.700 --> 01:08.080
Everyone! Gather around!

01:08.620 --> 01:12.340
We need to decide on something before we start overtime.

01:14.210 --> 01:15.920
That's it, right?

01:15.920 --> 01:18.470
Yeah, I think that's the best thing to do.

01:18.470 --> 01:19.220
Okay.

01:19.220 --> 01:21.840
All right! Let's go all out!

01:23.140 --> 01:26.020
Don't work so hard you hurt yourself again.

01:26.020 --> 01:27.600
We need you out there.

01:27.850 --> 01:32.690
One year ago I would have never imagined this happening.

01:32.690 --> 01:36.610
Oh! We're all getting so much better at basketball!

01:36.610 --> 01:38.110
I'm so happy!

01:38.570 --> 01:42.070
Let's go! Let's show them our teamwork!

01:43.870 --> 01:47.870
All the experience you've gathered up until now is your weapon!

01:48.200 --> 01:50.710
No matter what happens in these next 3 minutes,

01:50.710 --> 01:52.000
just go all out!

01:52.000 --> 01:53.210
Okay!

01:54.010 --> 01:58.020
Because You're Here, Tomoka

01:57.460 --> 01:58.170
Thank's for waiting.

01:58.590 --> 02:00.510
Let's continue what we've started.

02:05.760 --> 02:08.310
Is your foot okay?

02:08.310 --> 02:11.060
Oh? Are you worried about me?

02:12.350 --> 02:13.310
Thanks.

02:13.310 --> 02:14.860
Th-That's not what I—

02:14.860 --> 02:15.570
Maho!

02:15.570 --> 02:16.400
Okay!

02:16.400 --> 02:18.030
Here I go then!

02:19.860 --> 02:20.450
Airi!

02:20.450 --> 02:21.450
Got it!

02:21.450 --> 02:22.570
Hina-chan!

02:22.570 --> 02:23.740
Oh!

02:24.950 --> 02:26.490
Nice, Hina!

02:26.490 --> 02:28.830
See? We're gonna keep scoring!

02:48.220 --> 02:50.680
Hey, are you even trying?

02:50.680 --> 02:53.730
H-Huh? Of course I am!

02:53.730 --> 02:56.730
Then why are you acting like a scaredy-cat?

02:58.820 --> 03:02.360
I seriously hope you aren't worried about my foot.

03:02.360 --> 03:03.860
I just sprained it a little.

03:03.860 --> 03:05.370
Th-That's not true...

03:05.370 --> 03:09.370
If you don't go all out right now then you'll definitely regret it.

03:09.370 --> 03:13.000
Don't hold back and come at me with all you've got!

03:13.000 --> 03:14.830
I'll go all out, too!

03:17.970 --> 03:21.060
Watch out! I'm gonna steal it from you!

03:28.650 --> 03:30.740
I can't listen to your trash talk anymore.

03:30.740 --> 03:33.450
I'll show you what I've got!

03:35.160 --> 03:36.450
Nice shot, Rena.

03:37.160 --> 03:38.540
That's the way.

03:49.130 --> 03:50.170
Here I go!

04:20.200 --> 04:21.790
See? I'm fine.

04:24.500 --> 04:27.040
#13! Illegal use of hands!

04:27.500 --> 04:29.250
Five fouls! You're out!

04:32.840 --> 04:34.930
Did you see my true ability?

04:35.130 --> 04:37.890
Yeah! That was some good defense!

04:37.890 --> 04:41.140
I definitely won't foul the next time!

04:46.440 --> 04:50.190
I'll learn how to play proper 5-on-5 basketball by next time.

04:51.230 --> 04:52.190
I'm looking forward to that.

04:54.950 --> 04:57.620
She should apologize to us.

04:57.620 --> 05:01.660
We'll get much better the next time we play.

05:01.660 --> 05:05.160
We need to show her how 5-on-5
basketball is supposed to be played!

05:05.160 --> 05:05.960
Yep.

05:12.340 --> 05:14.510
<i>If I make both free throws, we'll be tied.</i>

05:15.510 --> 05:18.220
<i>That should make it easier on everyone else.</i>

05:31.900 --> 05:34.690
<i>This is bad. I'll end up...</i>

05:39.660 --> 05:45.040
<i>My job is to give the team a boost in morale! </i>

05:51.290 --> 05:52.710
Nice shot, Maho!

05:53.710 --> 05:56.420
Maho-chan has really improved.

05:56.420 --> 05:57.220
Yeah.

05:57.590 --> 06:01.470
<i>Maho is the spark that gets the team going.</i>

06:01.470 --> 06:04.210
<i>She's truly like "Fireworks".</i>

06:04.210 --> 06:07.730
But Maho isn't the only one.

06:09.400 --> 06:12.860
As a defender of Suzuridani, I won't let you pass!

06:14.110 --> 06:15.110
Maho!

06:17.030 --> 06:19.660
<i>Everyone knows how hard Hinata-chan has practiced.</i>

06:19.660 --> 06:24.410
<i>Her "Innocent Charm" makes
those around her play better!</i>

06:26.450 --> 06:27.330
Airi!

06:29.580 --> 06:32.000
We've worked so hard to get here...

06:32.750 --> 06:34.630
And we won't back down!

06:38.760 --> 06:40.510
<i>The "Prismatic Bud".</i>

06:40.510 --> 06:43.140
<i>Her talents have blossomed to their fullest.</i>

06:46.020 --> 06:47.770
Good one, Airi!

06:47.770 --> 06:51.150
They're playing better and better.

06:52.900 --> 06:55.980
Everyone! Stay on your marks!

06:55.980 --> 06:57.150
Close down the spaces!

06:57.150 --> 06:58.190
Okay!

06:58.610 --> 07:02.030
<i>She's able to survey the entire
court at such a critical moment.</i>

07:02.030 --> 07:05.990
<i>The calmness of the "Ice Age" is the pillar of Keishin! </i>

07:09.000 --> 07:10.080
Over here!

07:17.630 --> 07:21.470
As expected of Suzuridani. They can pull up from anywhere.

07:21.470 --> 07:23.760
They're a really good team.

07:23.760 --> 07:26.220
Their footwork and fundamentals are all solid.

07:26.680 --> 07:28.600
But we won't lose.

07:28.600 --> 07:31.560
We still have our ace!

07:32.400 --> 07:33.230
Here!

07:37.730 --> 07:39.030
Saki!

07:39.030 --> 07:40.570
Please, Tomo!

08:00.050 --> 08:01.300
I won't let you shoot!

08:06.960 --> 08:08.220
Yes!

08:10.640 --> 08:13.230
Why are you smiling <i>now</i>?

08:13.230 --> 08:16.440
I'm sorry, it's just that I'm having so much fun.

08:17.940 --> 08:23.570
If I hadn't met everyone at Keishin,
Subaru-san, and the girls on your team,

08:23.570 --> 08:27.240
I wouldn't have realized how much fun basketball can be.

08:29.580 --> 08:31.370
So, thank you.

08:33.040 --> 08:37.540
I guess I should thank you a little bit, too.

08:37.540 --> 08:41.260
You tried your best and are going to lose to us.

08:41.260 --> 08:44.500
We won't let you have the sweet taste of victory.

08:47.600 --> 08:53.850
<i>I know I'm not the
only one who wants to win.</i>

08:53.850 --> 08:56.690
<i>Everybody else feels the same way!</i>

09:02.020 --> 09:04.860
Wow! That was amazing, Tomoka-chan!

09:05.450 --> 09:08.910
<i>Tomoka, you're my "Shiny Gift".</i>

09:10.030 --> 09:11.870
<i>An irreplaceable treasure!</i>

09:16.540 --> 09:18.000
Aya! Over here!

09:18.000 --> 09:19.340
Miyu-senpai!

09:24.260 --> 09:25.970
Yes!

09:26.340 --> 09:27.470
30 seconds left.

09:27.930 --> 09:29.090
Crunch time.

09:32.930 --> 09:33.720
Hina!

09:35.640 --> 09:36.310
Saki!

09:38.100 --> 09:38.900
Airi!

09:41.860 --> 09:45.320
I'm a part of Suzuridani, too! I'll fight till the end...

09:45.780 --> 09:47.070
...Airi-san!

09:55.960 --> 09:57.540
<i>This ball...</i>

09:58.250 --> 10:00.040
<i>No one else will get it!</i>

10:00.630 --> 10:02.840
<i>This is for our win!</i>

10:03.380 --> 10:05.210
<i>The last shot!</i>

10:09.390 --> 10:11.390
<i>Tomoka!</i>

10:16.430 --> 10:19.230
Go! Tomoka!

10:21.150 --> 10:22.360
Not so fast!

10:24.780 --> 10:26.610
<i>She already got back?!</i>

10:26.610 --> 10:30.110
Suzuridani won't lose here!

10:51.300 --> 10:54.220
No count! 50-51!

10:54.220 --> 10:56.100
Suzuridani Girls' Academy wins!

10:59.520 --> 11:01.060
You did it, Miyu!

11:01.060 --> 11:02.350
We won!

11:11.030 --> 11:13.530
Thank you very much!

11:15.990 --> 11:16.540
I'm sorry.

11:17.950 --> 11:19.290
I didn't shoot it in time.

11:20.120 --> 11:22.000
You don't need to apologize.

11:22.000 --> 11:23.920
Yeah! That was a fun match!

11:23.920 --> 11:24.670
Yep!

11:24.670 --> 11:26.800
Oh! That's right!

11:28.880 --> 11:29.970
Hey...

11:32.760 --> 11:33.890
Um...

11:34.800 --> 11:35.800
Uh...

11:36.350 --> 11:37.670
That was a lot of fun.

11:39.810 --> 11:41.430
I had a lot of fun, too.

11:42.980 --> 11:46.440
But I want to get a proper victory.

11:47.020 --> 11:50.690
Let's play basketball through middle school, Tomoka.

11:51.990 --> 11:56.080
Okay! I also want to play you again sometime!

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
Name

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
Ashihara Rena

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
Date of birth

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
Blood type

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
Class     Suzuridani Girls School
5th Year, Class 2

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
Height

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
Bust size

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
None - "They'll just get in the way."

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
Person she
respects

12:17.100 --> 12:20.050
Herself.

12:28.940 --> 12:30.440
I'll leave them to you, Aoi.

12:30.440 --> 12:33.650
All right. I'll make sure to get them home safely.

12:34.070 --> 12:37.450
I don't want to admit it, but the sixth-years are amazing.

12:37.450 --> 12:38.330
Yeah.

12:38.330 --> 12:40.580
We need to train even harder.

12:40.580 --> 12:42.790
Can we become as good as them?

12:43.120 --> 12:45.670
We can! Someday, I'm sure we will.

12:45.670 --> 12:48.200
Yes. I think we'll get even better than them.

12:48.460 --> 12:51.260
Then let's talk about that together.

12:51.260 --> 12:52.420
Okay!

12:57.890 --> 13:00.600
Um, about Subaru...

13:00.600 --> 13:04.270
Yeah. I'll take him home a bit later.

13:04.270 --> 13:06.150
Thank you very much.

13:19.410 --> 13:24.330
<i>I don't think I could ever become a replacement for the bonds he has with those girls.</i>

13:29.670 --> 13:33.380
I'm sorry we lost again.

13:33.380 --> 13:35.510
What are you saying, Subarun?

13:35.510 --> 13:39.460
Boo! You aren't the reason we lost.

13:39.680 --> 13:45.230
Your support gave us the courage to fight!

13:45.230 --> 13:46.690
That's right!

13:46.690 --> 13:49.980
That was the best game we've ever played!

13:49.980 --> 13:53.810
They were just a little bit better.

13:55.150 --> 13:56.490
Thanks.

13:56.490 --> 14:00.440
But even so, this became your last official match.

14:03.040 --> 14:07.290
I think this was the most fun we've ever had.

14:07.290 --> 14:08.110
And...

14:11.250 --> 14:13.740
And it's not the end yet.

14:18.370 --> 14:19.680
That's right!

14:19.680 --> 14:23.630
We can still keep on playing in middle school!

14:23.630 --> 14:26.510
There's no way we'll stop
playing something so fun!

14:26.810 --> 14:29.760
Please keep on teaching us!

14:29.760 --> 14:37.020
Oh! We'll keep on getting
better in order to satisfy you!

14:37.020 --> 14:39.610
Even when we become middle schoolers...

14:39.610 --> 14:42.120
Even when we become high schoolers...

14:43.160 --> 14:45.780
You'll always be our coach!

14:47.450 --> 14:48.780
Everyone!

14:48.780 --> 14:52.380
Jeez, why are you all crying?

14:52.380 --> 14:54.540
You're all tears, too!

14:54.540 --> 14:57.550
It's so weird! Even though we aren't sad at all!

14:57.550 --> 15:00.420
Oh! I'm not sad, either!

15:01.680 --> 15:03.600
I wonder why...

15:05.760 --> 15:06.770
Me, too.

15:08.230 --> 15:13.020
I want to keep on coaching you all in basketball!

15:13.020 --> 15:17.810
As long as we have basketball, we will be together! I'm sure...

15:19.150 --> 15:21.310
As long as we have basketball...

15:28.450 --> 15:29.330
Subarun!

15:29.330 --> 15:30.250
Onii-chan!

15:32.880 --> 15:34.420
Subaru-san!

16:13.790 --> 16:16.590
I'm sorry for being a bit selfish.

16:16.590 --> 16:19.670
No, I don't mind at all.

16:22.220 --> 16:23.220
Tomoka?

16:23.220 --> 16:29.710
I-I have something... I want to ask you.

16:47.570 --> 16:49.200
It's so pretty!

16:50.410 --> 16:53.830
Yeah, it reminds me of that day.

16:55.500 --> 17:00.040
<i>I have a star I want to see.</i>

17:00.550 --> 17:03.010
I'm happy that you remembered.

17:03.010 --> 17:06.050
So what was the star you were looking for?

17:07.590 --> 17:09.540
It's probably that one.

17:09.970 --> 17:13.550
It's there, inside those bunch of stars.

17:14.310 --> 17:17.180
It feels just like our team.

17:18.190 --> 17:22.430
Pleiades. The constellation of Taurus.

17:22.940 --> 17:25.940
In Japanese, it's called "Subaru."

17:26.700 --> 17:29.190
It's a star that's bright and far away.

17:29.190 --> 17:32.370
Someone as small as me can't reach it.

17:34.080 --> 17:37.290
But one day I'll reach it.

17:37.290 --> 17:42.000
Me, along with everyone else, have worked so hard.

17:42.840 --> 17:45.760
Under the guidance of a kind coach.

17:45.760 --> 17:49.960
We learned how much fun basketball can be.

17:51.100 --> 17:54.850
I wanted to tell you those feelings of mine.

17:58.480 --> 18:03.150
I may not be able to play in any more matches as an elementary schooler,

18:03.150 --> 18:07.490
but can I keep on feeling this way?

18:14.110 --> 18:16.960
I should be the one asking you.

18:16.960 --> 18:20.960
I want to keep on working hard, just like that shining star.

18:21.500 --> 18:22.370
So...

18:23.250 --> 18:25.620
Will you please stay by my side?

18:28.840 --> 18:30.630
Yes!

18:45.640 --> 18:48.700
Tomoka... is the best...

18:48.700 --> 18:51.740
Subaru-kun! It's morning!

18:53.530 --> 18:55.990
You're so cute!

19:04.750 --> 19:06.540
G-Good morning!

19:07.840 --> 19:09.880
Is that your middle school uniform?

19:09.880 --> 19:13.290
Yes! I wanted to show you as soon as possible!

19:13.640 --> 19:16.600
It fits you really well! It's really cute!

19:18.020 --> 19:20.890
Th-Thank you very much!

19:22.190 --> 19:25.930
I see. Their opening ceremony?

19:26.150 --> 19:28.310
Must be tough on you.

19:28.310 --> 19:31.320
My Airi has grown so much!

19:31.320 --> 19:35.330
Yeah, we have to keep on moving, too.

19:35.330 --> 19:37.290
That's right, Subaru!

19:38.740 --> 19:41.750
The boy's basketball club has been reinstated!

19:41.750 --> 19:44.030
We can start again next week!

19:44.380 --> 19:45.960
R-Really?!

19:45.960 --> 19:46.790
How?!

19:47.130 --> 19:51.550
I spent summer vacation getting signatures and petitioning to the student council.

19:51.550 --> 19:54.540
I'm the vice president now!

19:54.720 --> 19:56.140
That's awesome, man!

19:56.140 --> 19:57.680
Thanks, Kazunari!

19:57.680 --> 20:00.390
That means it's time to practice!

20:00.640 --> 20:02.190
Yeah!

20:08.280 --> 20:14.160
As you progress into middle school, please keep on working hard at your studies and sports.

20:14.160 --> 20:21.330
I look forward to your maturation into people who can contribute to society.

20:21.330 --> 20:29.420
And please remember to
always live life to its fullest.

20:33.300 --> 20:36.010
All right! We'll do our best today!

20:36.010 --> 20:38.140
My, you seem quite hyper today.

20:38.140 --> 20:41.350
This is the first practice we've had since starting middle school.

20:41.350 --> 20:42.730
Oh!

20:42.730 --> 20:44.060
Our first experience!

20:45.480 --> 20:47.100
I'm looking forward to it!

20:47.100 --> 20:49.100
The first time, huh?

20:49.440 --> 20:53.860
It's been a long time since I started playing basketball.

20:53.860 --> 20:57.360
Oh yeah, why did you start
playing basketball, Tomoka?

21:01.330 --> 21:05.240
It was when I was very little. My mom and I—

21:05.240 --> 21:09.870
Mokkan! Subarun! Hurry up!

21:10.500 --> 21:12.090
Coming!

21:40.370 --> 21:43.950
You promised you'd play with me...

21:44.870 --> 21:46.200
Mom, you idiot.

21:49.540 --> 21:52.050
Oh, it's open just like they said it'd be.

22:15.860 --> 22:17.980
Yes! Only 99 more times!

22:23.790 --> 22:26.610
Ah, were you using the hoop?

22:29.670 --> 22:30.960
I see.

22:30.960 --> 22:34.130
I thought you played basketball, too.

22:34.130 --> 22:36.000
Basket... ball?

22:36.000 --> 22:38.220
Yep, basketball.

22:50.270 --> 22:51.470
Wow!

22:51.770 --> 22:54.980
It's a sport where you shoot the ball into the basket.

22:54.980 --> 22:57.490
Whoever scores the most wins.

23:04.020 --> 23:06.280
Basket... ball...

23:07.040 --> 23:09.030
Can I play it too?

23:10.170 --> 23:12.910
Of course! It's a lot of fun!

23:23.850 --> 23:25.510
Me, too...
